.         * Generating the dependent variable
.         *       As explained in our PAP we consider the treatment and the con
> trol to be "having one daughter" and "having one son" respectively. 
.         *       This ensures that the treatment is randomly assgined and a ca
> usal interpretation is warranted.
.         tab kidsex01

                         Sex 1st. Child |      Freq.     Percent        Cum.
----------------------------------------+-----------------------------------
                    [-2] Does not apply |          3        0.00        0.00
